WEBVTT

00:12:29.746 --> 00:12:34.086
Eventually, the whole number gets dialed
and I'm listening to the phone,

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:36.747
and my colleague picks up the phone
and he says to me,

00:12:37.697 --> 00:12:39.340
"Woo woo woo woo." (Laughter)

00:12:39.364 --> 00:12:42.799
(Laughter)

00:12:42.823 --> 00:12:44.673
And I think to myself,

00:12:44.697 --> 00:12:47.736
"Oh my gosh, he sounds
like a Golden Retriever!"

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.387
(Laughter)

00:12:49.411 --> 00:12:52.572
And so I say to him --
clear in my mind, I say to him:

00:12:52.596 --> 00:12:54.238
"This is Jill! I need help!"

00:12:54.262 --> 00:12:57.976
And what comes out of my voice is,
"Woo woo woo woo woo."

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.810
I'm thinking, "Oh my gosh,
I sound like a Golden Retriever."